# Cloudflare Pages Headers & Caching Strategy

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
